<h1>The Break : A Novel by Aidan Forcina.</h1>

<p>"I think I broke my dick." Arin whispered. "I just need to wait for it to go down" he murmured again. "What do you want me to do?" Lily said in a panic. "Just give it a second, it just has to go down"</p>
<p>A long heavy pause fills the room as for a short time they waited but nothing changed. "Why isn't it going down?" Arin asked to whoever may be listening.</p>

